# symbolic SATO template
# source include: dtplc067_prep.p GenSingleLabel, case "dtlbl060b.i" (default / label-type 0 path)
# branch: default / 4.5x3
#
# Ported field-for-field from the legacy include. Print-head reference offset below is the
# legacy right-hand engine family (S86RD/85R/85xrbd) value for genuine 4.5x3 stock, taken
# verbatim from dtplc067_prep.p:8358 - there's no per-device model setting on this side to
# pick 85L/S86LD instead.
#
# For narrower 4x3 stock, use lt_default_4x3.sato instead (separate file - the coordinate
# math differs enough on-press that it needs its own tuning, not just an offset tweak here).
#
# Known, documented omissions vs. the legacy label (no data source / not applicable here):
#   - machine/line/term tracking string next to the field labels
#   - prt-apply-type suffix on the "Color/Couleur" label
#   - French/Spanish color+shape repeat rows (no translated description data) - collapsed to
#     one row showing PartDescription
#   - prt-coverage text field
#   - grade highlight reverse-video box
#   - PEI/WA/COF/tone icon block and brand/customer-# highlight block - these only fire in the
#     legacy code for label-type 1/2/3, not label-type 0 (DALTILE default), so they're correctly
#     absent here rather than missing.

<STX>
